  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "塩味と　苦味が　強い　食材。強い塩味と　ハーブの苦味でバランスが　楽しい　ソーセージ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "짠맛과 쓴맛이 강한 식재료. 강한 짠맛과 허브의 쓴맛으로 재미있는 밸런스를 이룬 소시지다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "鹹味和苦味強勁的食材。強勁的鹹味和香草的苦味之拿捏使品嚐這種香腸成為一種樂趣。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût très salé et amer. Cette saucisse maintient un équilibre délicat entre la forte saveur salée et l’amertume des herbes.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Bei dieser sehr salzigen und bitteren Zutat kommt alles auf die Balance zwischen den beiden Aromen an.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El equilibrio entre el sabor salado de la carne y el amargo de los condimentos que lleva dentro hace de este un embutido muy interesante al paladar.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente molto salato e amaro. Il gusto molto salato della salsiccia viene controbilanciato dalle note amare delle erbe.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A very salty and bitter ingredient. The balance between the potent saltiness and the herbs’ bitterness make this sausage a pleasure.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
